{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/YlZcQRsaVnX2icFoiZknUA?from=industrynews&color_scheme=light&click_id=811090090","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:36.644492+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/YlZcQRsaVnX2icFoiZknUA?from=industrynews&color_scheme=light&click_id=811090090","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/G3P33w4JWcJWzIyuQWORzicjcEPWMFfWBcwZPtLdDxexAjJczicbLBLllMRZZ2Nic4UlMUke5fiaITr0ImGVwDxEOyzIVicL65YyTj5UiaWCUGpzg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>复旦大学化学系</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>2026年</span></span></strong></span><strong><span><span>全国优秀大学生夏令营</span></span></strong></p><p><span><strong><span><span>报名通知</span></span></strong></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sjXXsjYTibx4f9jra2LmbYicgI0ffia78QGsLMbUZmUzjl8yFKaTUiaq6Hx51WSwl1oIvrGE2J6vG6yaJIS406SCGO4czb4PaicmckwKEX2WibSxg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>为促进全国高校2027年优秀应届本科毕业生之间的思想和学术交流，帮助同学们深入了解我系的研究生教育，激发对化学科学研究的兴趣，鼓励大家将来积极申请我系推荐免试研究生，特举办本次夏令营活动。报名阶段相关事宜通知如下：</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>6月5日10:00 - 6月19日17:00</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.全国各高等学校2027年应届本科毕业生。</span></p><p><span>2.学业成绩优秀，预计可获得推免生推荐资格，必修课成绩均为及格以上，英语水平优良。</span></p><p><span>3.对化学领域的科学研究有浓厚的兴趣，具有较强的学术创新或实践应用能力。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.近期正面免冠彩色证件照片，电子版JPG格式，150×200像素，大小500K以内。</span></p><p><span>2.本科阶段现有完整成绩单（须加盖学校教务处或院系公章），JPG或PDF格式。</span></p><p><span>3.外语水平证明，如CET-4、CET-6、雅思、托福、专业外语成绩等。</span></p><p><span>4.有关获奖证书和学术科研成果，如发表论文、出版物或其他原创性工作。</span></p><p><span>5.个人自述（包括个人简历、本科期间学习科研工作简介、对未来读研和职业规划的初步设想，1000字左右）。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>申请人登录复旦大学研究生招生网（https://gsao.fudan.edu.cn），通过“研究生报考服务系统”中的“全国优秀大学生夏令营”进行网上报名。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>我系无须寄送纸质材料。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>相关说明</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>1.本次夏令营活动举办时间：7月4日至6日（拟定），计划营员人数约250名。活动内容包括我系各学科发展介绍讲座、师生座谈、实验室参观等，具体安排另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. 申请人应承诺填报信息和提交材料的真实性。如有弄虚作假，一经发现将取消申请资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3. 本次活动提供午餐和晚餐，住宿和交通自行安排、费用自理。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4. 联系方式：021-31242798，hxxyz@fudan.edu.cn。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>复旦大学化学系</span></p><p><span>2026年6月1日</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/G3P33w4JWcLSHXcw35EpCkGLFW1lmATR8MGpI3bVgxacgGib9YbQYBBWC5rVicdktakGnsVZdx9xmhOn3GgPEh29HE7p1JLedyouhWzPGJ8pA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"beac2e0c10c7e04ace9d0e355cd17d3d9ee7cf2c4acb0bdff67898c7e0adbb35","textLength":776,"sourceSha256":"786c549852be1b82a5730d9a9bf89f3ac55b2102e221f75bebd8d781ef6c71ea","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-7a4c66951d95a516c958","title":"2026年复旦大学化学系2026年全国优秀大学生夏令营报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:36.644492+00:00"}
